en:
"Oh, this?
It's a card of you, Lord Mersenne."{w}{p}"They were selling them at the souvenir shop over there,
and I just couldn't help buying one!"{w}

"There is no need to go so far as taking
that grueling exam to work at the Cathedral.
If you come to pray, you can see me like anyone else."{w}

"Sorry, but I can't give you the answer.{w}You have to face your own heart
and decide for yourself."{w}{p}"If times weren't what they are, I'd tell you
to go stand under Moonlight Falls.{w}Nothing beats a waterfall for training the spirit, you know."{w}

"Yes!"{w}{p}"I admired you so much, Lord Mersenne,
that I lost sight of the real reason
I came to Semnadoc!"{w}

"Because you realized this,
you have taken your first true step
as a member of the clergy, here and now!!"{w}

{0E}"Semnadoc is number one.{0F}
But number two is Lord Mersenne!
Ehehe~"{w}

"Welcome!{w}Welcome to the Caron Main Store,
run by Caron!!"{w}{p}"Huh? You can't find a Caron Branch?{w}Ugh, quit nagging. That's still to come!"{w}{p}"From here on, I'm going to spread my brand
and open stores in all sorts of cities!!{w}So you'd better buy plenty too, customer!!"{w}
